; A namespace says which authority minted an id, and the registry is the only
; thing which knows what those authorities are. An id in an authority nobody
; declared is an id nobody can say anything about.

; Near enough to a declared namespace to be a misspelling of it.
(node sit:S-101
  (kind Space)
  (type MeetingRoom)
  (geometry area))

; Near nothing, so the diagnostic lists what is declared instead.
(node plot:S-102
  (kind Space)
  (type MeetingRoom)
  (geometry area))
